OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and wet start, but
OL,6,Frain clearing southeastwards through
OL,7,Fthe morning. Patchy cloudy and sunny
OL,8,Fspells to follow with a few showers
OL,9,Fbubbling up in the afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Fchilly in a moderate northerly breeze,
OL,11,Fgustier towards southwestern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy cloud and scattered
OL,14,Fshowers continuing into the evening
OL,15,Fand overnight. A chillier night than
OL,16,Fthe last, particularly for inland
OL,17,Frural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
