OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FSunny spells in between
OL,6,Fscattered showers through the morning.
OL,7,FTurning dry for a time yet becoming
OL,8,Fincreasingly cloudy into the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Temperatures around average
OL,10,Ffor the time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith rain on Friday, heavy over
OL,14,Fwestern hills. This clearing
OL,15,Fsoutheastwards midday onwards, leaving
OL,16,Fpatchy cloud with scattered showers
OL,17,Finto Saturday, with a similar day on
OL,18,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
